549"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-09-05-05h54m08s615.png", "id": "1859906691235854", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1859906694569187_8541002586634942466_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tFhzaBGJ-ekQ7kNvwGyhBtn&_nc_oc=AdriW207oAl9BhSwuL2jh9UxhGQBv7dMgcNnA-geSGun4rdu6kHUBDDkPgnVkRvnSEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSokXOoaqYSxQC7RPFCDnN1PGMFHuk9O-L0Gl65h2LXTQ&oe=6AF1F20E"}, "display_name": "VR Giants", "keywords": ["giant", "tiny", "asymmetrical", "platformer", "coop"], "long_description": "The giant (Goliath) can help the tiny player (David) to cross abysses or reach higher platforms by offering his body as a bridge. David is highly vulnerable to fire, spikes and other dangers so Goliath must protect David. Only David can collect coins to open gates but requires the assistance of the giant Goliath to do so. The giant Goliath is bound by a chain and thereby his movement is limited to a specific play area. David can summon Goliath to new play areas. Step by step they are progressing through the levels and rescue their lost sheep.\nVR Giants sparks joy and teaches kindness and team communication in a fun and intuitive way providing hours of adventures for players of different skill levels.", "short_description": "VR Giants is an asymmetric two player co-op VR game in which a tiny player and a stone giant work together. The giant Goliath must protect and support the tiny player - David, as they both go on an adventure to rescue David's lost sheep. David can use the body of Goliath as a direct extension of the Level and climb it to get over abysses or reach higher platforms."}]}, "developer_name": "Risa Interactive", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrgiants.com/privacy-policy-for-bug-reports-in-vr-giants/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Risa Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_